   "Let our faith become visible through honesty, kindness, forgiveness, and service.",
   "Help us remember that true revival is not simply an emotional experience.",
   "It is a renewed commitment to You that changes the way we live.",
   "May we walk in the light of Your Word.",
   "May we encourage one another.",
   "May we seek peace.",
   "May we faithfully share the message of salvation through Jesus Christ.",
   "And may every generation continue to follow You with sincere hearts.",
   "In the mighty name of Jesus Christ, our Lord and Savior.",
   "Amen."
