     "Each had its own history, worship practices, and organizational structures.",
     "Daniel began to understand that Christianity in Africa could not be explained through one story or one country.",
     "The teacher then read Matthew 28:19–20.",
     "He explained that Christian growth was connected to the mission of making disciples and teaching people to follow Jesus.",
     "Daniel realized that the growth of Christianity was not simply about building churches or gathering large crowds.",
